The WebAssembly module (wasm/smlibwasm.wasm and its loader wasm/smlibwasm.mjs) contains the
SMLib solid modeling kernel and its SM_API wrapper from USD BRep, compiled with Emscripten,
and code taken from USD BRep's Python bindings (SmPyLib):

  USD BRep
