  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/usd-brep

The Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE.usd-brep. A few USD BRep source files are
compiled from copies modified by AWV Informatik AG to fix defects; the copies, each with a
notice of what was changed, are in third_party/patches of the smlibpy repository
(https://github.com/awv-informatik/smlibpy), whose third_party/patches/README.md lists the
changes.

The default font of Text, Lato Regular, is included unmodified (in dist/_fonts.js):

